<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F5F7F2', padding: '60px', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0A120E' }}>三个数字，都是可以验收的承诺</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#66756D', marginTop: 10 }}>证据</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#DDE4DC', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 52, marginTop: 40, height: 430 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1.15, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 132, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0A120E', lineHeight: 0.9 }}>30</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#0F5C40', marginBottom: 18 }}>秒</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 3, background: '#0F5C40', marginTop: 22, marginBottom: 18 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3F5148', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                停用账号、改密或登出后，已签发的访问令牌最迟 30 秒内失效。
                不用等 15 分钟的令牌自然过期。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 30 }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #DDE4DC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F5C40', lineHeight: 1 }}>5</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#66756D', marginBottom: 5 }}>分钟</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#3F5148', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    外链的票据有效期。链接可以长期存在，取内容的凭证只有 5 分钟。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #DDE4DC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F5C40', lineHeight: 1 }}>24</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#66756D', marginBottom: 5 }}>小时</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#3F5148', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    断点续传会话的保留窗口。换网络、关页面、换设备，重选同一文件即可续上。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, top: 606, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#C6EE4B', borderRadius: 6, padding: '12px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0A120E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            这些都是默认值，可按租户调整——每次调整都会写进审计，谁改的、什么时候改的都能查到。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, top: 676, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A9B5AE' }}>NeuroDMS · 产品概览</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A9B5AE' }}>09</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
